WEBVTT

00:22:29.511 --> 00:22:31.930
And we need to put pressure
on our governments,

00:22:32.889 --> 00:22:34.933
no matter where in the world,

00:22:34.974 --> 00:22:36.559
to change the policies,

00:22:36.559 --> 00:22:39.062
to put pressure on the Taliban,

00:22:39.062 --> 00:22:41.773
to change their policies
and make a change.

00:22:42.982 --> 00:22:47.112
KC: I think people can start
by watching "In Her Hands."

00:22:47.112 --> 00:22:51.032
It really is a beautiful film.

00:22:51.032 --> 00:22:53.868
It's incredibly compelling.

00:22:53.910 --> 00:22:57.247
And for me I found
there were threads of hope in there.

00:22:57.997 --> 00:23:01.459
So I think watching the film,